.TH CAMERA_FOLLOW 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_follow \- Move the camera toward target
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "void camera_follow(Camera *c, Vec2 target, float smoothing, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move the camera toward target. smoothing 0 snaps; larger values lag more (try 5\-10). Call from update, then draw with the interpolated target.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_set_bounds (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
